{"id": "2937822", "name": "הפרש פתרונות של שתי בעיות קושי בנקודה – cos² ו-sin²", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון כי הפונקציות \\(y_1(x),y_2(x)\\) הם פתרונות לבעיות הקושי הבאות:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\((1) \\quad{{CT:0}},\\quad y({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}},y'({{CT:1}})={{CT:3}}\\)</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\((2) \\quad {{CT:4}},\\quad y({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}},y'({{CT:1}})={{CT:3}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>קבעו האם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y_1({{CT:5}}) &gt; y_2({{CT:5}})\\)</span> או <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y_2({{CT:5}}) &gt; y_1({{CT:5}})\\)</span></p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>חשבו את הגבול הבא:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">\\(\\displaystyle{\\lim_{x\\to 0}\\frac{y_1(x)-y_2(x)}{{{CT:6}}\\cdot x^2}}=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> ההפרש של שני הפתרונות פותר מד\"ר עם מקדמים קבועים ואגף ימין קבוע (כי cos²+sin²=1) ותנאי התחלה אפס; פותרים אותה במפורש.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — ההפרש פותר בעיית התחלה פשוטה</b><br>נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=y_1-y_2\\)</span>. המד\"ר לינארית, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\)</span> פותרת את ההפרש של שתי המשוואות:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ u''-{{CT:7}}\\,u={{CT:8}}\\left(\\cos^2({{CT:9}})+\\sin^2({{CT:9}})\\right)={{CT:8}} \\]</p>ולתנאי ההתחלה זהים, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u({{CT:1}})=0,\\ u'({{CT:1}})=0\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — פתרון בעיית ההתחלה</b><br>המשוואה האופיינית <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lambda^2-{{CT:7}}=0\\)</span> נותנת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lambda=\\pm{{CT:10}}\\)</span>, ופתרון פרטי קבוע הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:11}}\\)</span>. לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u=C_1\\cosh({{CT:12}})+C_2\\sinh({{CT:12}}){{CT:11}}\\)</span>. מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u(0)=0\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C_1={{CT:13}}\\)</span>; מ-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u'(0)=0\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C_2=0\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ u(x)={{CT:13}}\\Big(\\cosh({{CT:12}})-1\\Big) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — סעיף א׳</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cosh({{CT:14}})>1\\)</span>, ולכן הסימן של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u({{CT:5}})\\)</span> הוא הסימן של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:8}}\\)</span>:[[if test=\"{{CT:17}}\"]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y_1({{CT:5}})>y_2({{CT:5}}) \\]</p>[[else]]<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y_2({{CT:5}})>y_1({{CT:5}}) \\]</p>[[/if]]</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 4 — סעיף ב׳</b><br>מטור טיילור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\cosh t=1+\\frac{t^2}{2}+O(t^4)\\)</span>: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u(x)={{CT:13}}\\cdot\\dfrac{{{CT:7}}x^2}{2}+O(x^4)={{CT:15}}x^2+O(x^4)\\)</span>. לכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\lim_{x\\to0}\\frac{y_1(x)-y_2(x)}{{{CT:6}}\\cdot x^2}=\\frac{{{CT:15}}}{{{CT:6}}}={{CT:16}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "nonotanswered"}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "mcq_correct(ta)", "tans": "[ans1]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b></div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b></div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "L", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> הגבול נכון</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> הגבול שגוי</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["L", "a", "b", "k", "label1", "label2", "ode1", "ode2", "ta", "uu", "x0", "x00", "y0", "y1"], "nvariants": 50}